; SYNTHETIC TEST FIXTURE. NOT A REAL CAVE OR FIELD SURVEY.
; Horizontal CRS EPSG:2180. Coordinates below use Survex normalized easting,northing.
; Arbitrary synthetic heights in metres: no real vertical datum asserted.
*title "SYNTHETIC EPSG2180 Aven WASM test"
*cs EPSG:2180
*cs out EPSG:2180
*begin synthetic
*date 2026.10.31
*fix a 565478.124426 154000.073675 1500
*entrance a
*data cartesian from to dx dy dz
a b 10 0 0
b c 0 20 0
c d 0 0 -5
d e -15 0 0
b f 3 4 -12
*flags surface
a s 0 -10 0
*flags not surface
*data passage station left right up down
a 2 2 3 1
b 2 3 3 1
c 3 2 4 1
d 2 2 3 2
e 1 2 2 1
*data
b 2 2 3 1
f 1 1 2 1
*end synthetic
